<title>DUBAI: NATIONAL IRANIAN OIL CO LIFTS BUNKER PRICES.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL IRANIAN OIL CO LIFTS BUNKER PRICES.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC) said on Wednesday it was raising its 280-cst bunker prices from Kharg Island to $104 a tonne from $103.50 with effect from August 14.</p>
<p>Bunker prices from Bandar Mahshahr will be $0.50 higher at $100.50 a tonne.</p>
</text>
